status: closed
priority: 0
tags[4]: documentation,operations,release,verification
created_at: "2026-07-21T17:24:37.212Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-21T17:43:30.651Z"
deadline: "2026-07-23T17:24:37.212Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-21T17:43:29.788Z"
author: codex-root
acceptance_criteria: No existing changelog data is lost; release only occurs for release-relevant changes; exact package version is verified through npm and Bun
definition_of_ready: "Live pm, changelog, tags, package registry, GitHub secrets, and pm-cli workflow state inspected"
parent: searx-auto-release
risk: high
confidence: 90
sprint: 2026-07-release-automation
release: next
resolution: Replaced stale manual-release documentation with the automated operating model and ran local plus isolated validation.
expected_result: "Maintainers can operate, diagnose, recover, and verify releases from documented commands and secrets."
actual_result: "Detailed docs cover all paths; 622 unit and 60 E2E tests pass; isolated release dry run, actionlint, audit, changelog checks, and package smoke are green."
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind}:
  searx-auto-release,related,"2026-07-21T17:24:37.212Z",codex-root,null
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-21T17:24:37.212Z",codex-root,Work is governed by the lossless changelog and exact-version publishing acceptance gates.
  "2026-07-21T17:40:54.147Z",codex-root,"Official actionlint v1.7.12 reported no workflow errors. Isolated clean clone /tmp/searx-release-test.GxKxaD completed release:pipeline:dry-run for v2026.7.21 and returned to a clean worktree."
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-21T17:24:37.212Z",codex-root,Publish once to npm and verify the same package through both npm and Bun consumers.
  "2026-07-21T17:40:54.147Z",codex-root,"Full validation: 622 unit tests, 60 E2E tests, zero bun audit findings, npm and Bun package smoke, generated changelog check, and preservation check."
learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-21T17:24:37.212Z",codex-root,GitHub tag pushes made with GITHUB_TOKEN do not trigger downstream push workflows; production uses RELEASE_PAT.
  "2026-07-21T17:40:54.147Z",codex-root,The installed pm-changelog extension needs @unbrained/pm-cli as a stable project peer; a temporary extraction symlink is not durable across pm processes.
files[3]{path,scope,note}:
